{"title":"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 21","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_21\">Problem 21</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 21\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Represent the hypotenuse of a right triangle by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> and the area by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />. The altitude on the hypotenuse is: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/c/e9c566c8f3384383da8dd61d7033a60492ba9628.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{A}{c}\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{2A}{c}\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{A}{2c}\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{A^2}{c}\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac{A}{c^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"411\" height=\"39\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/8/d08a8e664225cc94966e82429d6b45696d37db42.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw((0,0) -- (9/5,12/5) -- (5,0) -- cycle); draw((9/5,12/5) -- (9/5,0)); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"122\" />\nGiven that the area of the triangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />, and the formula for the area of a triangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/c/24c5ee83fc26b61fc29ddfb42e40bce4873d2e73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{bh}{2}=A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"60\" height=\"37\" />, we can replace <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> (the base) and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/8/8189a5b5a0917b8c93350827be4038af1839139d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> (the height) with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> (the hypotenuse) and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> (the altitude), we can rearrrange as follows:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/0/e30a27253f07c0d7faa3baa36486a62f705cb626.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{c*a}{2}=A\\]\" width=\"74\" height=\"33\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/0/88015e6b3e0136549f0b5c4a5e2bc8d8662c312b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[c*a=2A\\]\" width=\"81\" height=\"13\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/a/1ba96cdc040dd496e43ec94b1d0e6e08c65d66e4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a=\\textbf{(B)} \\frac{2A}{c}\\]\" width=\"86\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&am